project name : Online shopping Application

Task 1 — User Registration
- Issue Type: Story
- Summary: User Registration
- Priority: High
- Assignee: You
- Labels: frontend
- Start Date: 03 Nov 2026
- Due Date: 04 Nov 2026
User Story:
As a new user, I want to register an account so that I can access the online shopping application.

Description:
- Create a registration form.
- Accept name, email, and password.
- Validate user input.
- Display a successful registration message.
Acceptance Criteria:
- User can enter registration details.
- Invalid details display an error.
- Valid details create an account.

Task 2 — Product Search
- Issue Type: Story
- Summary: Product Search
- Priority: Medium
- Assignee: You
- Labels: backend
- Start Date: 04 Nov 2026
- Due Date: 05 Nov 2026
User Story:
As a customer, I want to search for products so that I can quickly find items I want to purchase.

Description:
- Add a search bar.
- Allow users to search by product name.
- Display matching products.
- Display a message if no products are found.
Acceptance Criteria:
- User can enter a product name.
- Matching products are displayed.
- No-match searches display an appropriate message.

Task 3 — Add to Cart
- Issue Type: Story
- Summary: Add Product to Cart
- Priority: Highest
- Assignee: You
- Labels: cart
- Start Date: 05 Nov 2026
- Due Date: 06 Nov 2026
User Story:
As a customer, I want to add products to my cart so that I can purchase multiple items together.

Description:
- Add an Add to Cart button.
- Display selected products in the cart.
- Allow users to change product quantity.
- Calculate the total price.
Acceptance Criteria:
- User can add a product to the cart.
- Cart displays the selected product.
- Total price updates when quantity changes.

